OL,3,GNEWSACentre at risk from erosion could
OL,4,Aget new home
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to secure a new home for a
OL,7,Fheritage centre that could be made
OL,8,Funusable by coastal erosion within 30
OL,9,Fyears have been recommended for
OL,10,Fapproval.
OL,12,FThe proposals would see Charmouth
OL,13,FParish Council given government funding
OL,14,Fto buy Hensleigh House as a potential
OL,15,Ffuture home for Charmouth Heritage
OL,16,FCoast Centre, on Dorset's Jurassic
OL,17,FCoast.
OL,19,FA council report warned the centre's
OL,20,Fseafront building could become
OL,21,Funinsurable and was projected to be
OL,22,Flost to erosion by about 2055.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
